  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Cities Research Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research which will produce new operationally-relevant knowledge and evidence on African &#x2018;cities as systems&#x2019;. The research will help policy makers and those who manage cities to tackle the most significant problems constraining growth and development in individual African Cities, leading to the development of, and investment in, more effective economic development and poverty-reduction policies and programmes in African cities, by FCDO and its partners.</narrative>
  </description>
